      the end of the flow, so its ~118px height extended the document's scrollHeight past the body and
      left an unexplained gap below the page. Fixed is pinned to the viewport and never contributes to
      scroll height, whatever the probes measure to. Consumers only read getComputedStyle custom
      properties off these (scripts/used-values.ts), never their box, so the positioning is free to change.
    */}
